    },
    {
      "text": "Bring water to a boil in a saucepan over high heat. Stir in raisins, then reduce the heat to medium and boil until raisins are very tender, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zLie0A4dlJxMImBh2Vh2UCDFSTI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/221008-easy-raisin-sauce-for-ham-VAT-step-02-d9b97f4c9ed54ae8b052ca3566f78f69.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/221008/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk in brown sugar and salt, then gradually whisk in cornstarch to avoid lumps forming. Simmer over low heat until glaze has thickened, about 10 minutes.",
